  "goal": "Current app context (preserve unless the user requests a change):\n{\"existing_goal\":\"\",\"existing_app\":[],\"conversation\":[]}\nUser request:\nCount people in this warehouse footage. Show boxes and save a crop for review whenever at least one person appears. Use confidence 0.2.",
  "model": "official Qwen3-14B Q4_K_M served as visionapp-planner",
